From 80a1672cf57a166beefaa13c9df0da2fe3343067 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: deLiseLINO <52623978+deLiseLINO@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:43:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(android): run on Android 12

Lower minSdk from 33 to 31. Every API 33 call that lint reported is now behind an SDK_INT check, with a working fallback below 33: Canvas versions of the AGSL visuals (agent activity orb, voice scope and orb, onboarding signal field, connection scope, reveal glow, Catch Up drift), androidx BackHandler instead of OnBackInvokedDispatcher, pre-33 equivalents for dictation support checks, geocoding, package info, vibration, URL coding and stream reads. The app language row is hidden below 33 because Android 12 has no per-app languages.

Verified: lintDebug and testDebugUnitTest pass for every module; on an API 31 emulator the app connects to an OpenCode v2 server, runs an agent turn and shows the activity orb, connection scope and settings.
